# The build context is the repo root; these paths are relative to it.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.claude
docs

# Never into an image. The publishable key arrives as a build arg and the
# secret only at runtime — see the Dockerfile.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.clerk

**/.DS_Store
